--- !u!114 &7391045850966740163
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4382026203799359397}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2efde7e9e75a7e747817347127bcb875, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TextTreeChooser
  PossibleSequencesMorale:
  - DialogueTree:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: Hello sweetie! How are you doing?
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 0.5
      Line: I've been hearing good things from everyone in town! You're doing a great
        job keeping everyone safe and happy!
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c999fc6f85824e147a0cd66eb210482f, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 3
      Line: Right, what I was talking about in my letter...
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49d5ada2fd17c884caf29537df14a9fd, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 3
      Line: Is... the knight... is there anybody at home looking after the knight?
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: Aside from you, of course!
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4cf9fc92d8d474a832248a18048d6d, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 2.5
      Line: No, not like a doctor or... I mean, like...
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: You tilt your head at the baker.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 0.5
      Line: Never mind, ha ha!
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: I suppose a loyal boy like you would be all the knight truly needs, always
        looking after each other! You two are always so sweet together.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4cf9fc92d8d474a832248a18048d6d, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 3
      Line: But, if it wouldn't be improper, it would be my greatest pleasure to
        be someone the knight relies on too.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 2
      Line: I just...  want to make something special for her, to show my appreciation
        for everything you both have done for all of us in town.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 2
      Line: And so, I can wish my... dearest friend a speedy recovery.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: Huh? Cheesecake? I thought so!
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4cf9fc92d8d474a832248a18048d6d, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: The knight always asks for an extra piece at parties... I certainly can
        do that!
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: Hopefully, I still have enough supplies after the forest monsters ransacked
        my bakery yesterday...
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c999fc6f85824e147a0cd66eb210482f, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: 'Thank you for your help, sweetie! I''ll let you get back to your adventuring. '
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: Don't worry about me, I'm a lot tougher than I look!
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4cf9fc92d8d474a832248a18048d6d, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: And... don't tell anyone I butt in on the knight's private life. It was
        really so rude of me!
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    townMoraleThreshold: 90
    knightHealthThreshold: 0
    currentDayThreshold: 0
  - DialogueTree:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: Hello sweetie! How are you doing?
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 3179903954906608466}
      TextSpeed: 1.5
      Line: I hope you're not letting the town get to you, I know you're doing the
        best you can... I'll believe in you no matter what!
